# Generated comment cache — comment.py rebuilds it whenever comments.json is newer. Committing it
# meant a checkout could carry a cache older than the JSON beside it, hiding newly added lines.
*.json.cache

# --- Bjorn runtime data (generated; keep dir skeleton via .gitkeep, never commit loot) ---
data/logs/*
!data/logs/.gitkeep
data/netkb.csv
data/netkb.csv.tmp
data/livestatus.csv
data/output/run_reports/
data/output/improvement_notes/
